    "updated_at": "2025-05-13T07:12:45Z",
    "body": "I wonder if that introduces a bit too much syntax. I think I would prefer your final examples (I'm assuming [] nested inside « » was a typo) to read something like this:\n\n> Let _result_ be _map_[\"`a`\"] default None.\n>\n> Let _intermediateResult_ be _map_[\"`a`\"] default « ».\n> Let _result_ be _intermediateResult_[\"`b`\"] default _default_.\n\nI do think this would be very valuable. You often want an infallible get operation.\n\n@domenic @tabatkins @jyasskin do you all have thoughts or know of others who might?",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
